  "body": "Seventh production-readiness stage, stacked on PR #54.\n\nScope is **independent reconstruction proof**.\n\nAdds:\n- `scan-independent-worker-receipt/0.1` verification;\n- `scan-independent-reconstruction-proof/0.1` lineage/adjudication report;\n- `scan-body verify-independent-reconstruction ...`;\n- challenge-manifest leak/tamper checks;\n- candidate tree hash binding;\n- submission hash binding;\n- enforced-isolation requirement (declared-only network isolation is rejected);\n- final challenge -> worker -> candidate -> private trial lineage verification.\n\nCI qualification uses three separate jobs:\n1. preparation creates a private source certification, public source-free challenge, and separate private evaluator;\n2. worker job performs **no repository checkout**, downloads **only** the public challenge, and generates the candidate inside a Linux network namespace;\n3. adjudication downloads the private evaluator and worker output, performs a fresh SCAN, scores the candidate, and emits the independent proof.\n\nThe worker is deliberately a deterministic reference worker. This proves the isolation/handoff/scoring machinery without external model secrets or services. It is explicitly **not** claimed as an external-LLM benchmark.\n\nRuntime/visual/timing equivalence remains out of scope and is the next roadmap stage.",
